<title>EGYPT: Egypt seeks 30,000 mt soybeans, loading November.</title>
<headline>Egypt seeks 30,000 mt soybeans, loading November.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Egyptian state's Food Industries Company said on Thursday it wanted to buy 30,000 tonnes of soybean, any origin, for loading by November 20 and delivery by December 15.</p>
<p>The deadline for bids is noon Cairo time/1000 GMT on October 30, it added.</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +20 2 578 3290/1</p>
